        "r": 208.19,
        "b": 732.40184
      },
      "content": "Operation under freezing conditions",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0897",
      "reading_order": 1035,
      "section": "NOTICE:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 724.64184,
        "r": 187.45,
        "b": 713.40184
      },
      "content": "NOTICE:",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0898",
      "reading_order": 1036,
      "section": "NOTICE:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 710.12184,
        "r": 557.6300000000005,
        "b": 686.88184
      },
      "content": "Do not expose an idle pump to freezing conditions. Drain all liquid that is inside the pump and the cooling coils. Failure to do so can cause liquid to freeze and damage the pump."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0899",
      "reading_order": 1037,
      "section": "Shut down the pump",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.0,
        "t": 661.75062,
        "r": 212.224,
        "b": 643.89462
      },
      "content": "Shut down the pump",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0092",
      "reading_order": 1038,
      "section": "Shut down the pump",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 70.428466796875,
        "t": 633.8443450927734,
        "r": 121.3157730102539,
        "b": 589.8239593505859
      },
      "image_path": "figures/figure_0092.png",
      "previous_block_id": "txt_0899",
      "next_block_id": "txt_0900"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0900",
      "reading_order": 1039,
      "section": "WARNING:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 630.1218299999999,
        "r": 197.11,
        "b": 618.88183
      },
      "content": "WARNING:",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0901",
      "reading_order": 1040,
      "section": "WARNING:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 615.60183,
        "r": 548.3700400000002,
        "b": 556.3618299999999
      },
      "content": "The pump can handle hazardous and toxic fluids. Identify the contents of  the pump and observe proper decontamination procedures in order to eliminate the possible exposure to any hazardous or toxic fluids. Wear the proper personal protective equipment. Potential hazards include, but are not limited to, high temperature, flammable, acidic, caustic, explosive, and other risks. You must handle and dispose of pumped fluid in compliance with the applicable environmental regulations."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0902",
      "reading_order": 1041,
      "section": "WARNING:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 143.99998,
        "t": 542.60183,
        "r": 286.5399799999999,
        "b": 531.3618299999999
      },
      "content": "Slowly close the discharge valve."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0903",
      "reading_order": 1042,
      "section": "WARNING:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 143.99996,
        "t": 528.87409,
        "r": 397.4499600000002,
        "b": 517.63409
      },
      "content": "Shut down and lock the driver to prevent accidental rotation."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0904",
      "reading_order": 1043,
      "section": "Deactivate the i-ALERT ™  Condition Monitor",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.99393999999998,
        "t": 499.50285999999994,
        "r": 385.58061999999995,
        "b": 481.64685999999995
      },
      "content": "Deactivate the i-ALERT ™  Condition Monitor",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0905",
      "reading_order": 1044,
      "section": "Deactivate the i-ALERT ™  Condition Monitor",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.00061999999997,
        "t": 467.87406999999996,
        "r": 533.8406300000004,
        "b": 444.63406999999995
      },
      "content": "NOTICE: Always deactivate the condition monitor when the pump is going to be shut down for an extended period of time. Failure to do so will result in reduced battery life."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0906",
      "reading_order": 1045,
      "section": "Deactivate the i-ALERT ™  Condition Monitor",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.00060000000002,
        "t": 435.14632,
        "r": 552.0406000000005,
        "b": 411.90632
      },
      "content": "Touch and hold a small magnet to the condition monitor over the ITT logo until the red LEDs blink three times."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0907",
      "reading_order": 1046,
      "section": "Deactivate the i-ALERT ™  Condition Monitor",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 162.00054,
        "t": 408.62633,
        "r": 510.44056000000035,
        "b": 385.38633
      },
      "content": "This should take 10-15 seconds if  the condition monitor is in normal operating mode and approximately five seconds if  the condition monitor is in alarm mode."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0908",
      "reading_order": 1047,
      "section": "Deactivate the i-ALERT ™  Condition Monitor",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.00052,
        "t": 382.89858,
        "r": 241.3405199999999,
        "b": 371.65858
      },
      "content": "Remove the magnet."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0909",
      "reading_order": 1048,
      "section": "Deactivate the i-ALERT ™  Condition Monitor",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.00052,
        "t": 364.89858,
        "r": 397.70052000000004,
        "b": 353.65858
      },
      "content": "If  the deactivation is successful, solid red LEDs will be displayed."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0910",
      "reading_order": 1049,
      "section": "Reset the i-ALERT ™  Condition Monitor",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.00448999999999,
        "t": 335.52736999999996,
        "r": 349.11381,
        "b": 317.67136999999997
      },
      "content": "Reset the i-ALERT ™  Condition Monitor",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0911",
      "reading_order": 1050,
      "section": "Reset the i-ALERT ™  Condition Monitor",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.00381999999996,
        "t": 303.89858,
        "r": 541.7638200000004,
        "b": 268.65858000000003
      },
      "content": "NOTICE: Always reset the condition monitor when the pump is started after maintenance, system change, or down-time. Failure to do so may result in false baseline levels that could cause the condition monitor to alert in error."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0912",
      "reading_order": 1051,
      "section": "Reset the i-ALERT ™  Condition Monitor",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 162.00381,
        "t": 259.17083,
        "r": 480.7438100000002,
        "b": 247.93083000000001
      },
      "content": "Touch a magnet to the condition monitor over the ITT logo to turn the power on."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0913",
      "reading_order": 1052,
      "section": "Reset the i-ALERT ™  Condition Monitor",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 162.00381,
        "t": 244.65084000000002,
        "r": 442.5538100000002,
        "b": 233.41084
      },
      "content": "The condition monitor begins to establish a new baseline vibration level."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0914",
      "reading_order": 1053,
      "section": "Make the final alignment of the pump and driver",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.99382,
        "t": 215.27965999999992,
        "r": 417.6258200000001,
        "b": 197.42365999999993
      },
      "content": "Make the final alignment of the pump and driver",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
